Prepare reports for submission to the National Treasury, PPRA, Ethics and Anti- Corruption Commission on matters relating to procurement and asset disposal;
Oversee the safeguarding of all procurement records and ensure the records are secure and safely maintained for ease of retrieval and future reference;
