Bachelor’s Degree in Commerce (Accounting or Business Administration with
Finance Option) or any other Business-related Degree from a recognized university;
Must have a minimum of eight (8) years experience, five of which (5) should be in a management role;
Must be a Certified Public Accountant (CPAK) or ACCA;
